I-960 DOCUMENTATION

Document the case record and file copies of all verification obtained.

Note: Use SSA Form 160 to notify SSA if an SSI beneficiary is in a public (including penal) institution or IMD or if the individual is considered an "inmate of a penal institution" because the penal authorities remain responsible for providing (or arranging for provision of) food and shelter to the individual.

